<title>FRANCE: Two ships loading flour in Rouen, one more due.</title>
<headline>Two ships loading flour in Rouen, one more due.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two ships are loading a total of 37,000 tonnes of flour at Rouen, port officials said on Tuesday,</p>
<p>The flour will be exported to Angola and Yemen, they said.</p>
<p>One more ship is expected in port very shortly to load 1,000 tonnes of flour.</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
